  "legacy_defects": [
    "the org.md write reports the character count as `bytes`: ten 'é' answer bytes 10, where UTF-8 holds 20 (docket org-admin-orgmd-put-reports-characters-as-bytes)"
  ],
  "scope": "Legacy boundary of the org administration routes (P01 F7) on disposable SQLite. Hub and net calls are spies; the routes, the ledger, the store's create and delete, the defaults file and the workspace files are real. Legacy conformance evidence only: not a runtime census, not PostgreSQL or Rust qualification."
